    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/d9fe841935dcddf85aa4db175fdad007.poster.avif?t=1739136375\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/d9fe841935dcddf85aa4db175fdad007.webm?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/d9fe841935dcddf85aa4db175fdad007.mp4?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy strategy with a mad dash of ice cold humour, Hurl snowballs, build high scores, find collectibles and dodge the narrators commentary. Explore ancient forests, deserts unlock cosmetics, maps,  and modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowpult is a relaxing score attack game where you take your shots and hope the narrator doesn't make a snowman out of you when you miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/6468e818762afaad54c17fcea3f794ee.avif?t=1739136375\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock achievements as you reach higher scores and dscover hidden messages from the games narrator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Filled with frostbitten humour and gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 9 different biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 20 unlockable customizations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/c47fe882df6dff828f20f8f8316ad032.poster.avif?t=1739136375\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/c47fe882df6dff828f20f8f8316ad032.webm?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/c47fe882df6dff828f20f8f8316ad032.mp4?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/d9fe841935dcddf85aa4db175fdad007.poster.avif?t=1739136375\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/d9fe841935dcddf85aa4db175fdad007.webm?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/d9fe841935dcddf85aa4db175fdad007.mp4?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy strategy with a mad dash of ice cold humour, Hurl snowballs, build high scores, find collectibles and dodge the narrators commentary. Explore ancient forests, deserts unlock cosmetics, maps,  and modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowpult is a relaxing score attack game where you take your shots and hope the narrator doesn't make a snowman out of you when you miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/6468e818762afaad54c17fcea3f794ee.avif?t=1739136375\" width=450 height=75 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock achievements as you reach higher scores and dscover hidden messages from the games narrator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Filled with frostbitten humour and gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 9 different biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 20 unlockable customizations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/c47fe882df6dff828f20f8f8316ad032.poster.avif?t=1739136375\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/c47fe882df6dff828f20f8f8316ad032.webm?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745000/extras/c47fe882df6dff828f20f8f8316ad032.mp4?t=1739136375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Snowpult is a Cozy strategy with a mad dash of ice cold humour, Close wormholes that threaten to tear open space by using the trusty catapult, Sling anything from giant snowballs to titantium ball bearings which definitely don't conceal immortal snails and rack up high scores.",
